  html: "<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Wet op de inlichtingen- en veiligheidsdiensten 2017 (Wiv 2017)</h2>\n<table class=\"w-full mb-6 border-collapse border border-red-900/30\"><thead><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-red-400 border-b border-red-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Field</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-red-400 border-b border-red-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Location</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">Netherlands</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Jurisdiction</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">National</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Status</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">ACTIVE</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Severity</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">4/5 — HIGH</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Categories</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">traffic_retention, data_retention</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Description</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Dutch bulk surveillance law permitting untargeted interception of cable communications (internet traffic) by AIVD and MIVD. Ministerial authorization required, oversight by Review Committee on Intelligence and Security Services (CTIVD).</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Severity Rationale</h2>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-2 border-orange-500/50 pl-4 mb-6 text-orange-400/70 italic\"><p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Universal application (bulk cable interception) [+1], no judicial oversight (ministerial authorization for bulk interception) [+1], irreversible data collection (untargeted interception and storage) [+1], mission creep from &#39;national security&#39; to broader uses [+0.5], digital exclusion not applicable [0]. Total: 3.5/5 rounded to 4/5</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Implementation Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">BULK SURVEILLANCE VIA CABLE INTERCEPTION. Key provisions: (1) &#39;Sleepnet&#39; (dragnet) - bulk interception of cable communications; (2) Untargeted collection of internet traffic; (3) Minister of Interior authorizes bulk interception; (4) CTIVD (Review Committee) provides oversight; (5) Data shared with foreign intelligence services (NSA, etc.). History: (1) 2017: Wiv 2017 passed replacing Wiv 2002; (2) 2018: Advisory referendum rejected Wiv 2017 (49.4% turnout, majority against); (3) Government ignored referendum result; (4) 2024: Law amended but bulk interception retained. Current status: Active use by AIVD (domestic) and MIVD (military). Concerns: (1) Untargeted collection = mass surveillance; (2) Ministerial authorization not independent judicial oversight; (3) Data retention periods unclear; (4) Sharing with foreign agencies (Five Eyes); (5) No notification of affected individuals. Opposition: (1) 2018 referendum showed public opposition; (2) Privacy First and digital rights groups challenging; (3) EDRi documenting violations. Workers&#39; concern: Bulk interception captures all worker communications, union organizing, strike planning - no protections for labor organizing activities.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[PRIMARY]</strong> <a href=\"https://wetten.overheid.nl/BWBR0041378/2024-01-01\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Official Dutch law - Wet op de inlichtingen- en veiligheidsdiensten 2017</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[CIVIL_SOCIETY]</strong> <a href=\"https://edri.org/our-work/mass-surveillance-of-telecommunications-document-pool/\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EDRi - Netherlands surveillance law analysis</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"border-red-900/40 my-6\" />\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-2 border-orange-500/50 pl-4 mb-6 text-orange-400/70 italic\"><p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Source:</strong> @grey-c0 / Navigators Guild<br>Retrieved via <a href=\"https://github.com/grey-c0/legislation\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">grey-c0/legislation</a><br>Integrated into scale_9.4 CAS pipeline — do not edit stubs manually.</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
